  ],
  "text": "The asteroid one is famous. It is not the worst one. Extinction usually means losing one species. This is a different scale entirely. Two hundred and fifty million years ago, ninety percent of sea life died. Siberia had been erupting for two million years without once stopping. All that carbon went into the sea, and the sea turned acidic. Recovery took millions of years. Every single time. And every recovery handed the planet to somebody completely different. Mammals only ever got their turn because the last one cleared the room. Five times life almost stopped. Five times it restarted as something else. One of these every day. Follow so you do not miss tomorrow.",
  "voice": "802e3bc2b27e49c2995d23ef70e6ac89",
  "model": "s2.1-pro-free"
}
